6. A day-old on-disk session renders as "Session stopped" with no date. Use capture_session.updated_at_unix_ms to show "Previous session stopped <age> ago" past a threshold.
7. When manual start is not configured, show a visible "Next step" line under the Start/Stop controls naming the complete launcher command:
